        "answer": {
          "short": "$20a^3b^7$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4a^2b^3\\times5ab^4&=20a^{2+1}b^{3+4}\\\\4a^2b^3\\times5ab^4&=20a^3b^7\\end{align*}$$",
