      {
        "id": "p26-q4-l",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "l",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{(4a^2b^3)^2}{3a^6b^4}\\div\\dfrac{ab^5}{(3a^3b^2)^3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$144a^6b^3$\n\nExpand the powers and multiply by the reciprocal of the second fraction.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{(4a^2b^3)^2}{3a^6b^4}\\div\\frac{ab^5}{(3a^3b^2)^3}&=\\frac{16a^4b^6}{3a^6b^4}\\times\\frac{27a^9b^6}{ab^5}\\\\\\frac{(4a^2b^3)^2}{3a^6b^4}\\div\\frac{ab^5}{(3a^3b^2)^3}&=\\frac{432a^{13}b^{12}}{3a^7b^9}\\\\\\frac{(4a^2b^3)^2}{3a^6b^4}\\div\\frac{ab^5}{(3a^3b^2)^3}&=144a^6b^3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
